{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Ability to cast a cantrip\n\nWell practiced in fundamental spellcasting, you gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You learn one Warmage Trick option of your choice from the Warmage class. If the Warmage Trick has a prerequisite of any kind, you can choose that invocation only if you\u0027re a Warmage who meets the prerequisite.\n\n- Whenever you gain a level, you can replace the Warmage Trick with another one from the Warmage class.","level":1}],"id":"Custom4e11014b-fc0a-46f7-93d6-7f5b535e6f90","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Cantrip Specialist [VSS] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}